ht|n|at|^*GA1,1.  You never preempt over a preempt^*N|
                  
ht|o|at|^*GA2,2.  Normally leading doubletons is not a particularly good lead^*N|
                  
ht|p|at|^*GA3,3.  You should only bid 3 over 3 if^*N|
                  
ht|q|at|^*GA4,4.  An interesting hand to bid after a DONT bid by partner^*N|
                  
ht|r|at|^*GA5,5.  Do not punish partner for competing^*N|
                  
ht|s|at|^*GA6,    ^*N|

