mb|P|mb|P|mb|1C|mb|P|mb|1S|mb|P|mb|2S|nt|^z@3^b@2^^|mb|P|MB|?|cp|8|AT|^B@2^*Bhondo717: ^*N|cp||at|My hand is barely worth an invitational bid. I will bid 3@C to invite. You bid a new suit to invite. I am asking partner to bid 4@S with 14+ or if the double fit in clubs and spades upgrades the North hand (for example they have 4 spades and 5 clubs).|
PG| ***** 18 ***** |


mb|3C|mb|P|mb|3S|mb|P|mb|P|mb|P|
