UP|52|nt|^z@3^b@2^^^B@2^B@2^*BA Kib: ^*NWhy did South pass on the first round? NS know they have at least 21 points.|
PG| ***** 77 ***** |


cp|8|AT|^^
^B@2^*Bhondo717: ^*N|cp||at|You make a good point. I admit I probably bid 2@S at an actual table. However, I mostly passed to discuss what West was going to bid as the situation was very unique.|
PG| ***** 78 ***** |


nt|^z@3^b@2^^|cp|8|AT|^B@2^*Bhondo717: ^*N|cp||at|West did well to go down one. We could have defended better also. At trick eight North should overtake my @D9 with the @DJ and play the @HJ and a club. Then we take another club and 2 more diamonds or at least one more diamond for down 2 or 3.

|
PG| ***** 79 ***** |


